{
  "_id": 23065,
  "id": "upon_the_first_echo_of_aha",
  "name": "Upon the First Echo of \"Aha\"",
  "desc": "THEY were once the most dazzling protagonist on stage.\nThe stars cycled through day and night on that carousel, and THEY used magic to illuminate the dim dusk.\nUpon the first echo of \"Aha,\" so laughed the masses.\n\nTHEY were once the most brilliant dream-maker behind the scenes, manipulating the cosmos with tricks and fooling vicious beasts with humor.\nUnder THEIR guidance, touring performances quietly raised their curtains beneath the Phantasmoon, bringing hope to every wish.\n\nWhen people grew accustomed to sitting in the audience, waiting for new sensory stimuli, the Elation seemed to have already found its standard answer.\nWhen the final game began and the curtains parted, only the mask of a God remained on stage.\nSome chose to break the dead silence, some attempted to take the stage, while THEY played the loyal audience, cheering for everyone's \"Aha Instant\"...\n\n\"Aha is not the name of the Elation. The so-called Elation is an answer everyone must find for themselves~\"\n\nNo one noticed when THEY left, nor did anyone know where THEY went.\nOnly in those moments when certain lives are born, on nights when fireworks bloom, or on the unlit sides of a particular stage...\nAn occasional chuckle echoed from among the billions, as if THEY were merely passing by, or had perhaps never left at all.",
  "rarity": 5,
  "pathType": "Elation",
  "pathTypeText": "Elation",
  "effectName": "Improv Tour",
  "effectTemplate": "Increases the wearer's base SPD by <span style=\"color:#f29e38ff\">#1[i]</span>. When using Skill on one other ally, gains <span style=\"color:#f29e38ff\">#2[i]</span> Punchline. This effect can trigger at most once after a gap of every #3[i] turn(s). Then, enables all allies to ignore <span style=\"color:#f29e38ff\">#4[i]%</span> of the enemy target's DEF when they deal DMG during this battle. This effect cannot be stacked.",
